paragraph.math:
$$\begin{array}{rll}
  {\ln y} & = & {\ln x^{\sqrt{x}} = \sqrt{x}\ln x} \\
  \frac{y^{\prime}}{y} & = & {\sqrt{x} \cdot \frac{1}{x} + \left( {\ln x} \right)\frac{1}{2\sqrt{x}}} \\
  y^{\prime} & = & {y\left( {\frac{1}{\sqrt{x}} + \frac{\ln x}{2\sqrt{x}}} \right) = x^{\sqrt{x}}\left( \frac{2 + \ln x}{2\sqrt{x}} \right)}
  \end{array}$$
